<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Hold Thou my hand: and closer, closer draw me</l><l>To Thy dear self, my hope, my joy, my all;</l><l>Hold Thou my hand: lest haply I should wander,</l><l>And missing Thee, my trembling feet should fall.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Hold Thou my hand: the way is dark before me</l><l>Without the sunlight of Thy face divine;</l><l>But when by faith I catch its radiant glory,</l><l>What heights of joy, what rapturous songs are mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
